{
  "date": "2026-10-30",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "报道称，谷歌钱包在开发Alipay+二维码付款功能",
  "title_en": "Report says Google Wallet is developing an Alipay+ QR code payment feature",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "科技网站Android Authority报道，谷歌钱包（Google Wallet）正在开发一个叫“Traveler QR”的功能。这个功能是在手机软件的代码里发现的。",
      "en": "The tech site Android Authority reported that Google Wallet is developing a feature called “Traveler QR”. The feature was found in the code of the phone app."
    },
    {
      "zh": "Alipay+是蚂蚁国际的跨境支付服务。有了这个新功能，用户到了支持的地区，不用手动开通，就能先扫描Alipay+合作商户的二维码，再用钱包里绑定的Visa卡或万事达卡付款。",
      "en": "Alipay+ is Ant International's cross-border payment service. With the new feature, when users are in a supported region, they would not need to switch it on by hand, and could scan the QR code of an Alipay+ partner merchant and then pay with a Visa or Mastercard linked in the wallet."
    },
    {
      "zh": "代码显示，第一个支持的地区是新加坡的Alipay+合作网络。以后，马来西亚、印度尼西亚和菲律宾也可能加入。",
      "en": "The code shows that the first supported region is the Alipay+ partner network in Singapore. Later, Malaysia, Indonesia and the Philippines may also be added."
    },
    {
      "zh": "谷歌钱包在巴西已经可以用二维码付Pix。现在，谷歌还没有正式宣布这个功能，也没有说什么时候上线。",
      "en": "In Brazil, Google Wallet can already pay with Pix by QR code. For now, Google has not officially announced this feature, and has not said when it will go live."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
